stateDiagram-v2
  state "Свободно" as Free
  state "Активно (ACTIVE)" as Active
  state "Нет связи (DISCONNECTED)" as Disconnected
  state "Вне игры (SITTING_OUT)" as SittingOut
  [*] --> Free
  Free --> Active : occupySeat() с бай-ином
  Active --> Disconnected : markDisconnected(), связь потеряна
  Disconnected --> Active : restore(), связь восстановлена за 60 с
  Disconnected --> SittingOut : setSittingOut(), прошло 60 с
  SittingOut --> Active : игрок вернулся
  Active --> Free : leaveTable()
  SittingOut --> Free : leaveTable() или стек равен 0
  Free --> [*]
